  [  6] jmpifz [ 51] ............................ if rollOver(1) then / else
  [  9] pushint8 200 ............................ <200>
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <200>
  [ 14] extcall 5 ............................... cursor(200)
  [ 16] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 18] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 20] thebuiltin 10 ........................... <the mouseH>
  [ 22] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 24] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite 60 to the mouseH
  [ 26] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 28] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 30] thebuiltin 11 ........................... <the mouseV>
  [ 32] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 34] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 60 to the mouseV
  [ 36] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 38] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 40] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 42] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 60 to 1
  [ 44] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 46] extcall 6 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 48] jmp [ 67]
  [ 51] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 52] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <0>
  [ 54] extcall 5 ............................... cursor(0)
  [ 56] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 58] pushzero ................................ <0>
